 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "As in part 2, plus fraudReports: a list of strings \"timestamp,unique_id\" each reporting an earlier request as fraud at that time (the report time is at least the reported request's timestamp). A request is also declined when its card number is the card of a reported request whose report time is strictly smaller than the request's timestamp. Return [unique_id, \"APPROVE\" or \"DECLINE\"] per request in timestamp order (ties keep input order).",
  "provenance": [
